{
  "_doc": "discover_sources.py input: how to find candidate sources for a market. {city} {country} {city_slug} {cc} {cc_lower} {City} {country_nospace} are filled per market. Search engines are tried in order; a query's results are cached 30 days in feeds/health/search_cache.json.",
